<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</title>
<headline>Ecuador cocoa and cocoa products export prices.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Here is a list of the minimum FOB</p>
<p>reference prices for exporting 100-lb (45.36-kilo) sacks of</p>
<p>Ecuadorean cocoa and cocoa products, effective Jan 9-15:</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Epoca......................$ 58.00</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer.....................$ 61.77</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Select..............$ 63.51</p>
<p>    Arriba Superior Summer Plantation Select...$ 66.70</p>
<p>    Cocoa butter...............................$163.32</p>
<p>    Residual butter............................$122.49</p>
<p>    Unsweeten or bitter cocoa,</p>
<p>    Cocoa liquor or paste......................$ 86.62</p>
<p>    Cocoa cake.................................$ 20.05</p>
<p>    Residual natural cake......................$  2.01</p>
<p>    Cocoa powder...............................$ 22.37</p>
</text>
